    "text": "I labelled all 7 columns and reported the profile for job 1.\n\n- `npi`: identifier, PHI (it identifies an individual provider, and I marked it when unsure)\n- `provider_first_name`, `provider_last_name`: name, PHI\n- `taxonomy_code`, `practice_state`, `accepting_new_patients`: code, not PHI\n- `effective_date`: date, not PHI. It's a roster effective date rather than a birth date, so I didn't mark it. Change it if the contract writer treats provider-record dates as PHI.\n\n`profile_file` returned no data because the feed has no contract yet, so the labels rest on `diff_schema` output only.",
